{"4272440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pump Crew", "steam_appid": 4272440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/26a251d49767e9577166b6904323d146.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/26a251d49767e9577166b6904323d146.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/26a251d49767e9577166b6904323d146.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pump Crew is an online co-op survival horror game where teamwork, communication, and poor decisions collide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable loot and pump SLOP to fund your mission and power your ship, travelling to more distant (and more dangerous) destinations. Explore entire planets and varied cave systems in your quest for glory (or hilarious incompetence).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/992f6f631a577fd8f48f4431a3a1cded.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=1170 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/992f6f631a577fd8f48f4431a3a1cded.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/992f6f631a577fd8f48f4431a3a1cded.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/6e7fa40344fac5982656d25c94280374.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/6e7fa40344fac5982656d25c94280374.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/6e7fa40344fac5982656d25c94280374.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to five friends are a seasoned crew of SLOP (<strong>S</strong>ubterranean <strong>L</strong>iquid <strong>O</strong>rganic <strong>P</strong>roduct) harvesters. Explore planet-scale terrains in your spaceship, then descend beneath the surface to pump valuable SLOP back to your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/8ca16cf3f205e3d40538ee7cb7cf75f7.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=1170 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/8ca16cf3f205e3d40538ee7cb7cf75f7.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/8ca16cf3f205e3d40538ee7cb7cf75f7.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/75280d81d60a0dbed723d70d9f316970.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/75280d81d60a0dbed723d70d9f316970.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/75280d81d60a0dbed723d70d9f316970.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the hose cart along with you so you can harvest SLOP, and while you're exploring collect valuable artefacts to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/158a031661529c59270fe07d71bfe1a3.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=1170 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/158a031661529c59270fe07d71bfe1a3.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/158a031661529c59270fe07d71bfe1a3.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/998c290f3ea107df5e6f14cfc8fb6e4c.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/998c290f3ea107df5e6f14cfc8fb6e4c.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/998c290f3ea107df5e6f14cfc8fb6e4c.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of the caves don't appreciate you taking their SLOP. Once the SLOP starts to flow, get out fast or deal with the consequences!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/26a251d49767e9577166b6904323d146.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/26a251d49767e9577166b6904323d146.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/26a251d49767e9577166b6904323d146.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pump Crew is an online co-op survival horror game where teamwork, communication, and poor decisions collide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable loot and pump SLOP to fund your mission and power your ship, travelling to more distant (and more dangerous) destinations. Explore entire planets and varied cave systems in your quest for glory (or hilarious incompetence).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/992f6f631a577fd8f48f4431a3a1cded.poster.avif?t=1782379737\" width=1170 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/992f6f631a577fd8f48f4431a3a1cded.webm?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/extras/992f6f631a577fd8f48f4431a3a1cded.mp4?t=1782379737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272440/ex